%% M8 sequence: merchant simulator demo. Planned design: follows contracts/openapi/webhook-service.v1.yaml and issue #21.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P0 as Presenter
    participant P1 as merchant-simulator
    participant P2 as Keycloak
    participant P3 as api-gateway
    participant P4 as parcel-service
    participant P5 as webhook-service
        P0->>P1: click Create order
        P1->>P2: POST /token grant_type=client_credentials, client merchant-demo
        P2-->>P1: access token with merchant_id claim
        P1->>P3: POST /api/v1/merchant/orders, bearer + Idempotency-Key
        P3->>P4: forward (JWT valid, rate limit per client)
        P4-->>P1: 201 parcel, the same key returns the same parcel
        Note over P4,P5: ParcelCreated reaches webhook-service over Kafka (see sequence-m8-signed-delivery)
        P5->>P1: POST /webhooks, signed parcel.created
        alt fail mode is on
            P1-->>P5: 503: webhook-service retries, then dead-letters
        else fail mode is off
            P1->>P1: recompute HMAC over the raw body, constant-time compare, t within 5 minutes
            alt signature wrong or t too old
                P1-->>P5: 400, shown as rejected on the page
            else valid
                P1->>P1: keep the event in memory, de-duplicated by id
                P1-->>P5: 200
                P1-->>P0: page lists the event as verified
            end
        end
        P0->>P1: toggle fail mode to show retries and DLQ
